The file holds, per parent and session (1070 sessions per book, 2014-09-01 -> 2019-01-02, base 1.000 at 2014-09-01's close): the hold-the-parent NAV (always IN) at 0 and 20.8 bps and the Part A (50/50 sleeve) and Part B (timed sleeve) NAV at 20.8 bps. It is NOT approved data and no other test may read it. Every value equals the corresponding run of daily_nav.csv (gate V4).
